  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Sustainable Social Protection System in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of the project is to support more people have increased access to social protection. It is expected that at the end of the project, the social protection system should be shock responsive at the federal and state level with a reinforced policy framework and a financial mechanism integrated in the national budget and planning efforts.The project to be implemented by UNICEF and ILO at the national level and Abia, Benue, Oyo and Sokoto states will support the interoperability of database and expansion of the National Social Register (NSR) to integrate more poor and vulnerable households.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
